WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
Light Condor Spire completes the prerequisite knockdown.

2
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:01.550
Lily approaches with a dash and short forward walk.

3
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.000
The retreat puts Ryu’s recorded throw out of range.

4
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.950
Standing heavy punch punishes the missed throw.

5
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:03.550
Forward heavy punch continues the punish.

6
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.200
Heavy Condor Wind completes the punish and gains a Wind stock.

7
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.000
Ryu falls after the heavy Wind finish.
